        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="strategy-text" value="- This HLD view shows core runtime flow only&#10;- Identity golden source is Microsoft Entra ID (strategic landing zone)&#10;- Federation/sync supports Azure, AWS, and on-prem AD integration&#10;- Security/governance controls are detailed in Logical, Network, and Auth diagrams&#10;- Reliability via managed services and decoupled processing&#10;- Observability through monitoring and alerting" style="text;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;spacingLeft=10;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
